         <block line-height="1"
                text-indent="1em"
                space-before.optimum="0pt"
                space-before.maximum="12pt">Full documentation of the Processing Model is provided in section <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/TD.html#TDPM)">http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/TD.html#TDPM</basic-link> of the TEI Guidelines, and we do not describe it further here.</block>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="d27e6107"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="18pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                space-after="6pt"
                space-before.optimum="12pt"
                text-indent="0em">17. The TEI simplePrint schema</block>
         <block line-height="1">Like other TEI customizations, TEI simplePrint is defined by reference to the TEI Guidelines. The following reference documentation provides formal specifications for each element, model class, attribute class, macro and datatype it uses. These concepts are further explained in the TEI Guidelines. </block>
         <block line-height="1"
                text-indent="1em"
                space-before.optimum="0pt"
                space-before.maximum="12pt">Specifications are provided here for each component which has been modified for inclusion in TEI simplePrint. Almost every textual element has been modified, if only to include a processing model component. Note that the cross references included in these specifications are to the section of the full TEI Guidelines where the subject is treated, and not to sections of the present document.</block>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="d27e6111"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="14pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                space-after="3pt"
                space-before.optimum="9pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1. Elements</block>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.TEI"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.1. &lt;TEI&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e6118">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;TEI&gt; </inline>(TEI document) contains a single TEI-conformant document, combining a single TEI header with one or more members of the <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">model.resourceLike</inline> class. Multiple TEI elements may be combined to form a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teiCorpus" text-decoration="underline">&lt;teiCorpus&gt;</basic-link> element. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DS.html#DS)">4. Default Text Structure</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CC.html#CCDEF)">15.1. Varieties of Composite Text</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Module</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>textstructure</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Attributes</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>Attributes <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global" text-decoration="underline">att.global</basic-link> (<inline>@xml:id</inline>, <inline>@n</inline>, <inline>@xml:lang</inline>, <inline>@xml:base</inline>, <inline>@xml:space</inline>)  (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.rendition"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.rendition</basic-link> (<inline>@rendition</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.linking"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.linking</basic-link> (<inline>@corresp</inline>, <inline>@next</inline>, <inline>@prev</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.analytic"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.analytic</basic-link> (<inline>@ana</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.facs" text-decoration="underline">att.global.facs</basic-link> (<inline>@facs</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.responsibility"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.responsibility</basic-link> (<inline>@cert</inline>, <inline>@resp</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.source"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.source</basic-link> (<inline>@source</inline>)) <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.typed" text-decoration="underline">att.typed</basic-link> (<inline>@type</inline>, <inline>@subtype</inline>) </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Contained by</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <block>
                                 <inline font-weight="bold">core: </inline>
                                 <inline>
                                    <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teiCorpus" text-decoration="underline">teiCorpus</basic-link>
                                 </inline>
                              </block>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">header: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teiHeader" text-decoration="underline">teiHeader</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">textstructure: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.text" text-decoration="underline">text</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">transcr: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.facsimile" text-decoration="underline">facsimile</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">This element is required. It is customary to specify the TEI namespace <inline font-family="Courier">http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0</inline> on it, using the <inline font-style="italic">xmlns</inline> attribute.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;TEI version="5.0" xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;teiHeader&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;fileDesc&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;titleStmt&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;title&gt;</inline>The shortest TEI Document Imaginable<inline>&lt;/title&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;/titleStmt&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;publicationStmt&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>First published as part of TEI P2, this is the P5
