                        <block line-height="1">This element should be used only to mark the name of the actor as given in the source. Chapter <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/ND.html#ND)">13. Names, Dates, People, and Places</basic-link> discusses ways of marking the components of names, and also of associating names with biographical information about a person.</block>
