                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">Addresses may be encoded either as a sequence of lines, or using any sequence of component elements from the <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">model.addrPart</inline> class. Other non-postal forms of address, such as telephone numbers or email, should not be included within an <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.address" text-decoration="underline">&lt;address&gt;</basic-link> element directly but may be wrapped within an <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.addrLine" text-decoration="underline">&lt;addrLine&gt;</basic-link> if they form part of the printed address in some source text.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
