                           <inline>&lt;body&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Nu scylun hergan hefaenricaes uard<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>metudæs maecti end his modgidanc<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>uerc uuldurfadur sue he uundra gihuaes<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>eci dryctin or astelidæ<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>he aerist scop aelda barnum<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>heben til hrofe haleg scepen.<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>tha middungeard moncynnæs uard<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>eci dryctin æfter tiadæ<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>firum foldu frea allmectig<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;trailer&gt;</inline>primo cantauit Cædmon istud carmen.<inline>&lt;/trailer&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/body&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
