 <inline>&lt;/castItem&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/castList&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;stage type="mix"&gt;</inline>The action takes place in and around the home surgery of
 Dr Bero, lately returned from the wars.<inline>&lt;/stage&gt;</inline>
