                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;cell&gt; </inline>contains one cell of a table. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/FT.html#FTTAB1)">14.1.1. TEI Tables</basic-link>]</block>
