               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">core: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.abbr" text-decoration="underline">abbr</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">choice</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.corr" text-decoration="underline">corr</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.expan" text-decoration="underline">expan</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.orig" text-decoration="underline">orig</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.reg" text-decoration="underline">reg</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.sic" text-decoration="underline">sic</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.unclear" text-decoration="underline">unclear</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">linking: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.seg" text-decoration="underline">seg</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">transcr: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.supplied" text-decoration="underline">supplied</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">Because the children of a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">&lt;choice&gt;</basic-link> element all represent alternative ways of encoding the same sequence, it is natural to think of them as mutually exclusive. However, there may be cases where a full representation of a text requires the alternative encodings to be considered as parallel.</block>
                        <block line-height="1"
                               text-indent="1em"
                               space-before.optimum="0pt"
                               space-before.maximum="12pt">Note also that <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">&lt;choice&gt;</basic-link> elements may self-nest.</block>
                        <block line-height="1"
                               text-indent="1em"
                               space-before.optimum="0pt"
                               space-before.maximum="12pt">Where the purpose of an encoding is to record multiple witnesses of a single work, rather than to identify multiple possible encoding decisions at a given point, the <inline hyphenate="false" color="black" font-family="Courier">&lt;app&gt;</inline> element and associated elements discussed in section <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/TC.html#TCAPLL)">12.1. The Apparatus Entry, Readings, and Witnesses</basic-link> should be preferred.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>An American encoding of <inline font-style="italic">Gulliver's Travels</inline> which retains the British spelling but also provides a version regularized to American spelling might be encoded as follows.<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>Lastly, That, upon his solemn oath to observe all the above
 articles, the said man-mountain shall have a daily allowance of
 meat and drink sufficient for the support of <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;sic&gt;</inline>1724<inline>&lt;/sic&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;corr&gt;</inline>1728<inline>&lt;/corr&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> of our subjects,
 with free access to our royal person, and other marks of our
<inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>favour<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>favor<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Schematron</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
&lt;s:assert test="count(*) &gt; 1" role="ERROR"&gt; Element "&lt;s:name/&gt;" must have at least two child elements.&lt;/s:assert&gt;</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Schematron</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
&lt;s:assert test="(tei:corr or tei:sic or tei:expan or tei:abbr or tei:reg or tei:orig) 
 and ((tei:corr and tei:sic) or (tei:expan and tei:abbr) or (tei:reg 
 and tei:orig))"
 role="ERROR"&gt; Element "&lt;s:name/&gt;" must have corresponding corr/sic, expand/abbr,
 reg/orig &lt;/s:assert&gt;</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;alternate minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.choicePart"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="choice"/&gt;
 &lt;/alternate&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
element choice { att.global.attributes, ( model.choicePart | choice )* }</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Processing Model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;model output="plain"
 predicate="sic and corr" behaviour="inline"&gt;
&lt;param name="content" value="corr[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model output="plain"
 predicate="abbr and expan" behaviour="inline"&gt;
&lt;param name="content" value="expan[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model output="plain"
 predicate="orig and reg" behaviour="inline"&gt;
&lt;param name="content" value="reg[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model predicate="sic and corr"
 behaviour="alternate"&gt;
&lt;param name="default" value="corr[1]"/&gt;
&lt;param name="alternate" value="sic[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model predicate="abbr and expan"
 behaviour="alternate"&gt;
&lt;param name="default" value="expan[1]"/&gt;
&lt;param name="alternate" value="abbr[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model predicate="orig and reg"
 behaviour="alternate"&gt;
&lt;param name="default" value="reg[1]"/&gt;
&lt;param name="alternate" value="orig[1]"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
            </table-body>
         </table>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.cit"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.33. &lt;cit&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e20507">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;cit&gt; </inline>(cited quotation) contains a quotation from some other document, together with a bibliographic reference to its source. In a dictionary it may contain an example text with at least one occurrence of the word form, used in the sense being described, or a translation of the headword, or an example. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html#COHQQ)">3.3.3. Quotation</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DS.html#DSGRP)">4.3.1. Grouped Texts</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/DI.html#DITPEG)">9.3.5.1. Examples</basic-link>]</block>
