                           <inline>&lt;div type="chapter"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;!-- ... --&gt;</inline> and his heart was going like mad and yes I said yes I will Yes.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;closer&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;dateline&gt;</inline>
