                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;body&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;div type="part"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;head&gt;</inline>Fallacies of Authority<inline>&lt;/head&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>The subject of which is Authority in various shapes, and the object, to repress all
     exercise of the reasoning faculty.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;div n="1" type="chapter"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;head&gt;</inline>The Nature of Authority<inline>&lt;/head&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>With reference to any proposed measures having for their object the greatest
       happiness of the greatest number [...]<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;div n="1.1" type="section"&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;head&gt;</inline>Analysis of Authority<inline>&lt;/head&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>What on any given occasion is the legitimate weight or influence to be attached to
         authority [...] <inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;/div&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;div n="1.2" type="section"&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;head&gt;</inline>Appeal to Authority, in What Cases Fallacious.<inline>&lt;/head&gt;</inline>
    <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>Reference to authority is open to the charge of fallacy when [...] <inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;/div&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;/div&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/div&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/body&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
