                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;docImprint&gt;</inline>Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1987<inline>&lt;/docImprint&gt;</inline>
                        </block>Imprints may be somewhat more complex: <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
