                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">A consistent format should be adopted.</block>
                        <block line-height="1"
                               text-indent="1em"
                               space-before.optimum="0pt"
                               space-before.maximum="12pt">Particularly where cataloguing is likely to be based on the content of the header, it is advisable to use generally recognized authority lists for the exact form of personal names. </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
