                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;editorialDecl&gt; </inline>(editorial practice declaration) provides details of editorial principles and practices applied during the encoding of a text. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD53)">2.3.3. The Editorial Practices Declaration</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD5)">2.3. The Encoding Description</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CC.html#CCAS2)">15.3.2. Declarable Elements</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
