 <inline>&lt;measure unit="MiB" quantity="4.2"&gt;</inline>About four megabytes<inline>&lt;/measure&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;measure unit="pages" quantity="245"&gt;</inline>245 pages of source
   material<inline>&lt;/measure&gt;</inline>
