                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">
                           <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.idno" text-decoration="underline">&lt;idno&gt;</basic-link> should be used for labels which identify an object or concept in a formal cataloguing system such as a database or an RDF store, or in a distributed system such as the World Wide Web. Some suggested values for <inline font-style="italic">type</inline> on <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.idno" text-decoration="underline">&lt;idno&gt;</basic-link> are <inline font-family="Courier">ISBN</inline>, <inline font-family="Courier">ISSN</inline>, <inline font-family="Courier">DOI</inline>, and <inline font-family="Courier">URI</inline>.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
