                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="ISBN"&gt;</inline>978-1-906964-22-1<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="ISSN"&gt;</inline>0143-3385<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="DOI"&gt;</inline>10.1000/123<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="URI"&gt;</inline>http://www.worldcat.org/oclc/185922478<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="URI"&gt;</inline>http://authority.nzetc.org/463/<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="LT"&gt;</inline>Thomason Tract E.537(17)<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="Wing"&gt;</inline>C695<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;idno type="oldCat"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;g ref="#sym"/&gt;</inline>345
<inline>&lt;/idno&gt;</inline>
                        </block>In the last case, the identifier includes a non-Unicode character which is defined elsewhere by means of a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.glyph" text-decoration="underline">&lt;glyph&gt;</basic-link> or <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.char" text-decoration="underline">&lt;char&gt;</basic-link> element referenced here as <inline font-family="Courier">#sym</inline>.</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
