                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teidata.enumerated"
                                                                  text-decoration="underline">teidata.enumerated</basic-link>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                             <table-row>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline font-weight="bold">Suggested values include:</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="18pt"
                                                                  provisional-label-separation="6pt"
                                                                  text-indent="0em"
                                                                  margin-right="10pt"
                                                                  space-before="6pt"
                                                                  space-after="6pt">
                                                         <list-item space-before.optimum="4pt">
                                                            <list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                                               <block text-align="start"
                                                                      font-weight="bold"
                                                                      keep-together.within-line="always">gloss</block>
                                                            </list-item-label>
                                                            <list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                                               <block font-weight="normal">
                                                                  <block> </block>each list item glosses some term or concept, which is given by a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.label" text-decoration="underline">&lt;label&gt;</basic-link> element preceding the list item.</block>
                                                            </list-item-body>
                                                         </list-item>
                                                         <list-item space-before.optimum="4pt">
                                                            <list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                                               <block text-align="start"
                                                                      font-weight="bold"
                                                                      keep-together.within-line="always">index</block>
                                                            </list-item-label>
                                                            <list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                                               <block font-weight="normal">
                                                                  <block> </block>each list item is an entry in an index such as the alphabetical topical index at the back of a print volume.</block>
                                                            </list-item-body>
                                                         </list-item>
                                                         <list-item space-before.optimum="4pt">
                                                            <list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                                               <block text-align="start"
                                                                      font-weight="bold"
                                                                      keep-together.within-line="always">instructions</block>
                                                            </list-item-label>
                                                            <list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                                               <block font-weight="normal">
                                                                  <block> </block>each list item is a step in a sequence of instructions, as in a recipe.</block>
                                                            </list-item-body>
                                                         </list-item>
                                                         <list-item space-before.optimum="4pt">
                                                            <list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                                               <block text-align="start"
                                                                      font-weight="bold"
                                                                      keep-together.within-line="always">litany</block>
                                                            </list-item-label>
                                                            <list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                                               <block font-weight="normal">
                                                                  <block> </block>each list item is one of a sequence of petitions, supplications or invocations, typically in a religious ritual.</block>
                                                            </list-item-body>
                                                         </list-item>
                                                         <list-item space-before.optimum="4pt">
                                                            <list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                                               <block text-align="start"
                                                                      font-weight="bold"
                                                                      keep-together.within-line="always">syllogism</block>
                                                            </list-item-label>
                                                            <list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                                               <block font-weight="normal">
                                                                  <block> </block>each list item is part of an argument consisting of two or more propositions and a final conclusion derived from them.</block>
                                                            </list-item-body>
                                                         </list-item>
                                                      </list-block>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                             <table-row>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <block line-height="1">Previous versions of these Guidelines recommended the use of <inline font-style="italic">type</inline> on <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.list" text-decoration="underline">&lt;list&gt;</basic-link> to encode the rendering or appearance of a list (whether it was bulleted, numbered, etc.). The current recommendation is to use the <inline font-style="italic">rend</inline> or <inline font-style="italic">style</inline> attributes for these aspects of a list, while using <inline font-style="italic">type</inline> for the more appropriate task of characterizing the nature of the content of a list.</block>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                             <table-row>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <block line-height="1">The formal syntax of the element declarations allows <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.label" text-decoration="underline">&lt;label&gt;</basic-link> tags to be omitted from lists tagged <inline>&lt;list type="gloss"&gt;</inline>; this is however a semantic error.</block>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                          </table-body>
                                       </table>
                                    </block>
                                 </table-cell>
                              </table-row>
                           </table-body>
                        </table>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
