               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>In the following example, the translator has supplied a footnote containing an explanation of the term translated as "painterly": <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">And yet it is not only
 in the great line of Italian renaissance art, but even in the
 painterly <inline>&lt;note place="bottom" type="gloss"
 resp="#MDMH"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;term xml:lang="de"&gt;</inline>Malerisch<inline>&lt;/term&gt;</inline>. This word has, in the German, two
 distinct meanings, one objective, a quality residing in the object,
 the other subjective, a mode of apprehension and creation. To avoid
 confusion, they have been distinguished in English as
<inline>&lt;mentioned&gt;</inline>picturesque<inline>&lt;/mentioned&gt;</inline> and
<inline>&lt;mentioned&gt;</inline>painterly<inline>&lt;/mentioned&gt;</inline> respectively.
<inline>&lt;/note&gt;</inline> style of the
 Dutch genre painters of the seventeenth century that drapery has this
 psychological significance. </block>For this example to be valid, the code <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">MDMH</inline> must be defined elsewhere, for example by means of a responsibility statement in the associated TEI header:<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;respStmt xml:id="MDMH"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;resp&gt;</inline>translation from German to English<inline>&lt;/resp&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;name&gt;</inline>Hottinger, Marie Donald Mackie<inline>&lt;/name&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/respStmt&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>The global <inline font-style="italic">n</inline> attribute may be used to supply the symbol or number used to mark the note's point of attachment in the source text, as in the following example:<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">Mevorakh b. Saadya's mother, the matriarch of the
 family during the second half of the eleventh century, <inline>&lt;note n="126" anchored="true"&gt;</inline> The
 alleged mention of Judah Nagid's mother in a letter from 1071 is, in fact, a reference to
 Judah's children; cf. above, nn. 111 and 54. <inline>&lt;/note&gt;</inline> is well known from Geniza documents
 published by Jacob Mann.</block>However, if notes are numbered in sequence and their numbering can be reconstructed automatically by processing software, it may well be considered unnecessary to record the note numbers.</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;macroRef key="macro.specialPara"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
element note
{
   att.global.attributes,
   att.placement.attributes,
   att.pointing.attributes,
   att.typed.attributes,
   att.written.attributes,
   attribute anchored { text }?,
   attribute targetEnd { list { + } }?,
   macro.specialPara
}</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Processing Model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;model predicate="@place" behaviour="note"&gt;
&lt;param name="place" value="@place"/&gt;
&lt;param name="label" value="@n"/&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model predicate="parent::div and not(@place)"
 behaviour="block"&gt;
&lt;outputRendition&gt;margin-left: 10px;margin-right: 10px;
 font-size:smaller;&lt;/outputRendition&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
&lt;model predicate="not(@place)"
 behaviour="inline"&gt;
&lt;outputRendition scope="before"&gt;content:" [";&lt;/outputRendition&gt;
&lt;outputRendition scope="after"&gt;content:"] ";&lt;/outputRendition&gt;
&lt;outputRendition&gt;font-size:small;&lt;/outputRendition&gt;
&lt;/model&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
            </table-body>
         </table>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.notesStmt"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.100. &lt;notesStmt&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e53630">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;notesStmt&gt; </inline>(notes statement) collects together any notes providing information about a text additional to that recorded in other parts of the bibliographic description. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD27)">2.2.6. The Notes Statement</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD2)">2.2. The File Description</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Module</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>header</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Attributes</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>Attributes <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global" text-decoration="underline">att.global</basic-link> (<inline>@xml:id</inline>, <inline>@n</inline>, <inline>@xml:lang</inline>, <inline>@xml:base</inline>, <inline>@xml:space</inline>)  (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.rendition"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.rendition</basic-link> (<inline>@rendition</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.linking"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.linking</basic-link> (<inline>@corresp</inline>, <inline>@next</inline>, <inline>@prev</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.analytic"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.analytic</basic-link> (<inline>@ana</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.facs" text-decoration="underline">att.global.facs</basic-link> (<inline>@facs</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.responsibility"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.responsibility</basic-link> (<inline>@cert</inline>, <inline>@resp</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.source"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.source</basic-link> (<inline>@source</inline>))</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Contained by</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <block>
                                 <inline font-weight="bold">header: </inline>
                                 <inline>
                                    <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.biblFull" text-decoration="underline">biblFull</basic-link>
                                    <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.fileDesc" text-decoration="underline">fileDesc</basic-link>
                                 </inline>
                              </block>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">core: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.note" text-decoration="underline">note</basic-link>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.relatedItem" text-decoration="underline">relatedItem</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">Information of different kinds should not be grouped together into the same note.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;notesStmt&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;note&gt;</inline>Historical commentary provided by Mark Cohen<inline>&lt;/note&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;note&gt;</inline>OCR scanning done at University of Toronto<inline>&lt;/note&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/notesStmt&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;alternate minOccurs="1"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.noteLike"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="relatedItem"/&gt;
 &lt;/alternate&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
