                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">Detailed analyses of quantities and units of measure in historical documents may also use the feature structure mechanism described in chapter <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/FS.html#FS)">18. Feature Structures</basic-link>. The <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.num" text-decoration="underline">&lt;num&gt;</basic-link> element is intended for use in simple applications.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
