                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>If all that is desired is to call attention to the original version in the copy text, <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.orig" text-decoration="underline">&lt;orig&gt;</basic-link> may be used alone:<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>But this will be a <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>meere<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline> confusion<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>And hardly shall we all be <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>vnderstoode<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>More usually, an <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.orig" text-decoration="underline">&lt;orig&gt;</basic-link> will be combined with a regularized form within a <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.choice" text-decoration="underline">&lt;choice&gt;</basic-link> element:<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>But this will be a <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>meere<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>mere<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> confusion<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>And hardly shall we all be <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;orig&gt;</inline>vnderstoode<inline>&lt;/orig&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;reg&gt;</inline>understood<inline>&lt;/reg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
