         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.prefixDef"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.111. &lt;prefixDef&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e59328">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;prefixDef&gt; </inline>(prefix definition) defines a prefixing scheme used in <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">data.pointer</inline> values, showing how abbreviated URIs using the scheme may be expanded into full URIs. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/SA.html#SAPU)">16.2.3. Using Abbreviated Pointers</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Module</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>header</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Attributes</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>Attributes <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global" text-decoration="underline">att.global</basic-link> (<inline>@xml:id</inline>, <inline>@n</inline>, <inline>@xml:lang</inline>, <inline>@xml:base</inline>, <inline>@xml:space</inline>)  (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.rendition"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.rendition</basic-link> (<inline>@rendition</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.linking"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.linking</basic-link> (<inline>@corresp</inline>, <inline>@next</inline>, <inline>@prev</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.analytic"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.analytic</basic-link> (<inline>@ana</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.facs" text-decoration="underline">att.global.facs</basic-link> (<inline>@facs</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.responsibility"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.responsibility</basic-link> (<inline>@cert</inline>, <inline>@resp</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.source"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.source</basic-link> (<inline>@source</inline>)) <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.patternReplacement"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.patternReplacement</basic-link> (<inline>@matchPattern</inline>, <inline>@replacementPattern</inline>) <table text-align="left"
                               font-size="9pt"
                               table-layout="fixed"
                               width="100%"
                               id="d27e59440">
                           <table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/>
                           <table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/>
                           <table-body text-indent="0pt">
                              <table-row>
                                 <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                    <block>ident</block>
                                 </table-cell>
                                 <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                    <block>supplies a name which functions as the prefix for an abbreviated pointing scheme such as a private URI scheme. The prefix constitutes the text preceding the first colon.<table text-align="left"
                                              font-size="9pt"
                                              table-layout="fixed"
                                              width="100%"
                                              id="d27e59449">
                                          <table-column column-number="1" column-width="20%"/>
                                          <table-column column-number="2" column-width="80%"/>
                                          <table-body text-indent="0pt">
                                             <table-row>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline font-weight="bold">Status</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline>Required</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                             <table-row>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <inline font-weight="bold">Datatype</inline>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                                <table-cell padding="2pt" text-align="left">
                                                   <block>
                                                      <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teidata.prefix" text-decoration="underline">teidata.prefix</basic-link>
                                                   </block>
                                                </table-cell>
                                             </table-row>
                                          </table-body>
                                       </table>
                                    </block>
                                 </table-cell>
                              </table-row>
                           </table-body>
                        </table>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Contained by</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <block>
                                 <inline font-weight="bold">header: </inline>
                                 <inline>
                                    <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.listPrefixDef" text-decoration="underline">listPrefixDef</basic-link>
                                 </inline>
                              </block>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">core: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.p" text-decoration="underline">p</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                           <block>
                              <inline font-weight="bold">linking: </inline>
                              <inline>
                                 <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.ab" text-decoration="underline">ab</basic-link>
                              </inline>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">The abbreviated pointer may be dereferenced to produce either an absolute or a relative URI reference. In the latter case it is combined with the value of <inline font-style="italic">xml:base</inline> in force at the place where the pointing attribute occurs to form an absolute URI in the usual manner as prescribed by <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.w3.org/TR/xmlbase/)">XML Base</basic-link>.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">So that the value of this attribute may be mapped directly to a URI prefix, the value is limited to <inline color="black" font-family="Helvetica">teidata.prefix</inline>.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;prefixDef ident="ref"
 matchPattern="([a-z]+)"
 replacementPattern="../../references/references.xml#$1"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline> In the context of this project, private URIs with
   the prefix "ref" point to <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>div<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline> elements in
   the project's global references.xml file.
 <inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/prefixDef&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;classRef key="model.pLike" minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"/&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Schema Declaration</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
element prefixDef
{
   att.global.attributes,
   att.patternReplacement.attributes,
   attribute ident { text },
   model.pLike*
}</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
            </table-body>
         </table>
         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.profileDesc"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.112. &lt;profileDesc&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e59562">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;profileDesc&gt; </inline>(text-profile description) provides a detailed description of non-bibliographic aspects of a text, specifically the languages and sublanguages used, the situation in which it was produced, the participants and their setting. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD4)">2.4. The Profile Description</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD11)">2.1.1. The TEI Header and Its Components</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Module</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>header</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
