                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;ref&gt; </inline>(reference) defines a reference to another location, possibly modified by additional text or comment. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html#COXR)">3.6. Simple Links and Cross-References</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/SA.html#SAPT)">16.1. Links</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
