                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;refsDecl&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;cRefPattern matchPattern="([A-Za-z0-9]+) ([0-9]+):([0-9]+)"
  replacementPattern="#xpath(//body/div[@n='$1']/div[$2]/div3[$3])"/&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/refsDecl&gt;</inline>
                        </block>This example is a formal representation for the referencing scheme described informally in the following example.</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;refsDecl&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;p&gt;</inline>References are made up by concatenating the value for the
 <inline>&lt;att&gt;</inline>n<inline>&lt;/att&gt;</inline> attribute on the highest level <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>div<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline>
   element, followed by a space, followed by the sequential
   number of the next level <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>div<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline> followed by a colon
   followed by the sequential number of the next (and lowest)
   level <inline>&lt;gi&gt;</inline>div<inline>&lt;/gi&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/p&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/refsDecl&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
