                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">If present on this element, the <inline font-style="italic">status</inline> attribute should indicate the current status of the document. The same attribute may appear on any <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.change" text-decoration="underline">&lt;change&gt;</basic-link> to record the status at the time of that change. Conventionally <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.change" text-decoration="underline">&lt;change&gt;</basic-link> elements should be given in reverse date order, with the most recent change at the start of the list.</block>
                     </block>
