                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;seg type="preamble"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;seg&gt;</inline>Sigmund, <inline>&lt;seg type="patronym"&gt;</inline>the son of Volsung<inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>, was a king in Frankish country.<inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;seg&gt;</inline>Sinfiotli was the eldest of his sons ...<inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;seg&gt;</inline>Borghild, Sigmund's wife, had a brother ... <inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/seg&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
