                           <inline>&lt;seriesStmt&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;title&gt;</inline>Machine-Readable Texts for the Study of Indian Literature<inline>&lt;/title&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;respStmt&gt;</inline>
