                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">for his nose was as sharp as
 a pen, and <inline>&lt;choice&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;sic&gt;</inline>a Table<inline>&lt;/sic&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;corr&gt;</inline>a' babbld<inline>&lt;/corr&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/choice&gt;</inline> of green fields.</block>
                     </block>
