                               space-after.optimum="4pt">I am dr Sr yr
<inline>&lt;supplied reason="illegible"
 source="#amanuensis_copy"&gt;</inline>very humble Servt<inline>&lt;/supplied&gt;</inline>
 Sydney Smith</block>
