                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;docTitle&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;titlePart type="main"&gt;</inline>THE FORTUNES
   AND MISFORTUNES Of the FAMOUS
   Moll Flanders, &amp;amp;c.
 <inline>&lt;/titlePart&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;titlePart type="desc"&gt;</inline>Who was BORN in NEWGATE,
   And during a Life of continu'd Variety for
   Threescore Years, besides her Childhood, was
   Twelve Year a <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Whore<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>, five times a <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Wife<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline> (wherof
   once to her own Brother) Twelve Year a <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Thief,<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>
   Eight Year a Transported <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Felon<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline> in <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Virginia<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>,
   at last grew <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Rich<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>, liv'd <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Honest<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>, and died a
 <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Penitent<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline>.<inline>&lt;/titlePart&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/docTitle&gt;</inline>
                        </block>
                     </block>
