                           <inline>&lt;trailer&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>In stead of FINIS this advice <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>I<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline> send,<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;l&gt;</inline>Let Rogues and Thieves beware of <inline>&lt;lb/&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;hi&gt;</inline>Hamans<inline>&lt;/hi&gt;</inline> END.<inline>&lt;/l&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/trailer&gt;</inline>
                        </block>From EEBO A87070</block>
