         <block keep-with-next.within-page="always"
                id="TEI.xenoData"
                text-align="left"
                font-family="Times"
                font-size="12pt"
                font-weight="bold"
                font-style="italic"
                space-after="2pt"
                space-before.optimum="4pt"
                text-indent="0em">17.1.165. &lt;xenoData&gt;</block>
         <table text-align="left"
                font-size="9pt"
                table-layout="fixed"
                width="100%"
                id="d27e85018">
            <table-column column-number="1" column-width="25%"/>
            <table-column column-number="2" column-width="75%"/>
            <table-body text-indent="0pt">
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell number-columns-spanned="2"
                              border-before-style="solid"
                              border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">&lt;xenoData&gt; </inline>(non-TEI metadata) provides a container element into which metadata in non-TEI formats may be placed. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/HD.html#HD9)">2.5. Non-TEI Metadata</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Module</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>header</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Attributes</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>Attributes <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global" text-decoration="underline">att.global</basic-link> (<inline>@xml:id</inline>, <inline>@n</inline>, <inline>@xml:lang</inline>, <inline>@xml:base</inline>, <inline>@xml:space</inline>)  (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.rendition"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.rendition</basic-link> (<inline>@rendition</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.linking"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.linking</basic-link> (<inline>@corresp</inline>, <inline>@next</inline>, <inline>@prev</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.analytic"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.analytic</basic-link> (<inline>@ana</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.facs" text-decoration="underline">att.global.facs</basic-link> (<inline>@facs</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.responsibility"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.responsibility</basic-link> (<inline>@cert</inline>, <inline>@resp</inline>)) (<basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.global.source"
                                    text-decoration="underline">att.global.source</basic-link> (<inline>@source</inline>)) <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.att.typed" text-decoration="underline">att.typed</basic-link> (<inline>@type</inline>, <inline>@subtype</inline>) </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Member of</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.model.teiHeaderPart"
                                       text-decoration="underline">model.teiHeaderPart</basic-link>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Contained by</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block>
                           <block>
                              <block>
                                 <inline font-weight="bold">header: </inline>
                                 <inline>
                                    <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.teiHeader" text-decoration="underline">teiHeader</basic-link>
                                 </inline>
                              </block>
                           </block>
                        </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">May contain</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>Character data only</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>This example presumes that the prefix <inline font-family="Courier">dc</inline> has been bound to the namespace <inline font-family="Courier">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/</inline> and the prefix <inline font-family="Courier">rdf</inline> is bound to the namespace <inline font-family="Courier">http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#</inline>. Note: The <inline font-style="italic">about</inline> attribute on the <inline font-family="Courier">rdf:Description</inline> in this example gives a URI indicating the resource to which the metadata contained therein refer. The <inline font-family="Courier">rdf:Description</inline> in the second <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.xenoData" text-decoration="underline">&lt;xenoData&gt;</basic-link> block has a blank <inline font-style="italic">about</inline>, meaning it is pointing at the <inline font-style="italic">current</inline> document, so the RDF is about the document within which it is contained, i.e. the TEI document containing the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.xenoData" text-decoration="underline">&lt;xenoData&gt;</basic-link> block. Similarly, any kind of relative URI may be used, including fragment identifiers (see ). Do note, however, that if the contents of the <basic-link internal-destination="TEI.xenoData" text-decoration="underline">&lt;xenoData&gt;</basic-link> block are to be extracted and used elsewhere, any relative URIs will have to be resolved accordingly.<block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
