               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Note</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block line-height="1">The position of every zone for a given surface is always defined by reference to the coordinate system defined for that surface. </block>
                        <block line-height="1"
                               text-indent="1em"
                               space-before.optimum="0pt"
                               space-before.maximum="12pt">A graphic element contained by a zone represents the whole of the zone.</block>
                        <block line-height="1"
                               text-indent="1em"
                               space-before.optimum="0pt"
                               space-before.maximum="12pt">A zone may be of any shape. The attribute <inline font-style="italic">points</inline> may be used to define a polygonal zone, using the coordinate system defined by its parent surface.</block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;surface ulx="14.54" uly="16.14" lrx="0"
 lry="0"&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;graphic url="stone.jpg"/&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;zone points="4.6,6.3 5.25,5.85 6.2,6.6 8.19222,7.4125 9.89222,6.5875 10.9422,6.1375 
 11.4422,6.7125 8.21722,8.3125 6.2,7.65"/&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/surface&gt;</inline>
                        </block>This example defines a non-rectangular zone: see the illustration in section .</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Example</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
                           <inline>&lt;facsimile&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;surface ulx="50" uly="20" lrx="400"
  lry="280"&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;zone ulx="0" uly="0" lrx="500" lry="321"&gt;</inline>
   <inline>&lt;graphic url="graphic.png "/&gt;</inline>
  <inline>&lt;/zone&gt;</inline>
 <inline>&lt;/surface&gt;</inline>
                           <inline>&lt;/facsimile&gt;</inline>
                        </block>This example defines a zone which has been defined as larger than its parent surface in order to match the dimensions of the graphic it contains.</block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">Content model</inline>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-end-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <block font-family="Courier"
                               background-color="lightgray"
                               color="black"
                               white-space-treatment="preserve"
                               linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                               white-space-collapse="false"
                               wrap-option="no-wrap"
                               text-indent="0em"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               start-indent="12pt"
                               text-align="start"
                               font-size="6pt"
                               space-before.optimum="4pt"
                               space-after.optimum="4pt">
&lt;content&gt;
 &lt;alternate minOccurs="0"
  maxOccurs="unbounded"&gt;
  &lt;textNode/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.graphicLike"/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.global"/&gt;
  &lt;elementRef key="surface"/&gt;
  &lt;classRef key="model.linePart"/&gt;
 &lt;/alternate&gt;
&lt;/content&gt;
    </block>
                     </block>
                  </table-cell>
               </table-row>
               <table-row>
                  <table-cell border-after-style="solid"
                              border-start-style="solid"
                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
