                              padding="2pt"
                              text-align="left">
                     <block>
                        <inline font-weight="bold">att.global.source</inline> provides an attribute used by elements to point to an external source. [<basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/ST.html#STGAso)">1.3.1.1.4. Sources, certainty, and responsibility</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/CO.html#COHQQ)">3.3.3. Quotation</basic-link>
                        <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.tei-c.org/release/doc/tei-p5-doc/en/html/TS.html#TSBAWR)">8.3.4. Writing</basic-link>]</block>
                  </table-cell>
