                        <block line-height="1">Attributes using this datatype must contain a single word which follows the rules defining a legal XML name (see <basic-link external-destination="url(http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml/#dt-name)">http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml/#dt-name</basic-link>): for example they cannot include whitespace or begin with digits.</block>
