         <block line-height="1"
                text-indent="1em"
                space-before.optimum="0pt"
                space-before.maximum="12pt">The following elements are modified by the TEI simplePrint specification, mostly by the addition of a processing model, but in other cases by additional constraints on the attributes they may have, or the values those attributes may take. Additional examples are also provided for some of them. </block>
